          "name": "Evanston Rides: Adult Social Ride",
          "slug": "evanston-rides-adult-social-ride-2",
          "description": "<div>Join us for an invigorating bike ride designed just for adults. Whether you're a seasoned cyclist or just dusting off your old bike, we plan to break into fast and leisurely groups, so these rides are perfect for all skill levels. Explore the beauty of Evanston and the North Shore, meet fellow biking enthusiasts, and discover the hidden gems of our community. Best of all, these rides are entirely free, so grab your helmet and join us! Please bring a bike light to be sure you get home safely.<span>\u00a0</span><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSf9n36wu_Um2EiGishBB8s9PotsudpfeDxKHG0U03NNHJwgfg/viewform?usp=publish-editor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><em>REGISTER HERE</em></a><em><span>\u00a0</span>so that we know how many riders to expect on this date.</em><br><br></div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Start:<span>\u00a0</span></strong>This ride will leave from<span>\u00a0</span><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Fountain+Square/@42.0469134,-87.6842176,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x880fd00dc9c98231:0x96ddbf8b65df2336!8m2!3d42.0469094!4d-87.6816373!16s%2Fg%2F12lppt07f?entry=ttu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Fountain Square</a><span>\u00a0</span>at 5:30PM<span>\u00a0</span><em>(please arrive early to get situated)</em></li>\n<li><strong>Route Description:</strong><span>\u00a0</span>Evanston Loop ride<span>\u00a0</span><em>(leisurely group riding approximately 10 miles roundtrip, and fast group riding perhaps 20 miles)</em>\n<ul>\n<li>PLEASE BRING A BIKE LIGHT</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>End:<span>\u00a0</span></strong>This ride will end with an optional happy-hour at<span>\u00a0</span><a href=\"https://ridgevilletavern.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ridgeville Tavern</a><span>\u00a0</span>in downtown Evanston, where those in attendance can enjoy a<span>\u00a0</span><strong>10% discount</strong><span>\u00a0</span>on food & beverage purchases that evening! Riders in attendance will also be entered into a drawing for a $25<span>\u00a0</span><a href=\"https://app.yiftee.com/gift-card/evanston\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Evanston E-Gift Card</a>.</li>\n</ul>",
